{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>去日本自由行最怕離港後才發現錯過附近的限定祭典或煙花大會！由於許多在地活動資訊多為日文，遊客要獲得所有資訊的確有點難度。近日 Threads有一位熱心網友開發了一款免費神級網站「Matsuri Map 祭典地圖」，將全日本的限定活動一地圖整合，成為遊日必備的行程規劃神器！多謝你啊！！！😭😭😭</p><p>「Matsuri Map」將煙花大會、紅葉賞楓、學園祭及神社祭典等 7 大主題活動直接標示在地圖上。只需拉動地圖或彈性設定時間區間，即可一眼看清指定區域與日期內的熱門活動。地圖標籤更設有直觀的時間進度條，越滿代表活動越接近！點擊標籤不僅能即時查看舉辦地點、時間與簡介，更貼心附上官方網站連結，還能透過讚好與留言跟網友交流情報。網友大讚非常方便！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179233922297273389_19166039076ad4ed1768ca3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179233922481431651_11770512276ad4ed1944d3f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179233922711225884_6178824946ad4ed1be30e1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179233922996288429_18620666506ad4ed1e4382a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179233923163397522_5099328026ad4ed2056d45.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17923392346037815_15028796046ad4ed271ddc7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179233924748553283_2626371966ad4ed2fc2158.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T16:19:10.694832+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":392,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T16:00:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T21:57:40.136740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T16:17:34.765599+00:00","content_hash":"8e88d12fde354bfae49b3633bee0fdf3a